The nomenclatures used throughout industry can sometimes be contradictory, particularly between complete-melting versus partial-melting (sintering). Many companies that utilize a particular AM category either alter the process slightly or call the process by a different name, which can complicate classifications. Table 2 lists the common acronyms and trade names associated with the main metal AM processes.
